information, icons,

00:47:23.640 --> 00:47:26.220
descriptions,
sample invocations.

00:47:26.220 --> 00:47:27.930
And then there's an
approval process.

00:47:27.930 --> 00:47:32.650
There's a set of both automatic
and manual checks that get run.

00:47:32.650 --> 00:47:35.340
So right now for your
